OL,3,AEnergy bills forecast to go up by #443
OL,4,Aa year from January as UK inflation
OL,5,Arate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new forecast, from energy consultancy
OL,8,FCornwall Insight, suggests energy bills
OL,9,Fcould go up 26% from January - that's
OL,10,F#443 a year
OL,12,FMillions of homes in England, Scotland
OL,13,Fand Wales are on tariffs affected by
OL,14,Fregulator Ofgem's price cap, set every
OL,15,Fthree months. The next change will be
OL,16,Fofficially announced next Wednesday
OL,18,FMeanwhile, the UK inflation rate rose
OL,19,Fagain in October, hitting 3.6% - the
OL,20,Ffourth consecutive monthly rise and the
OL,21,Fhighest rate in a year
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
