OL,3,AEnergy bills forecast to go up by #443
OL,4,Aa year from January as UK inflation
OL,5,Arate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this month, the Bank raised
OL,8,Finterest rates to 4% in an effort to
OL,9,Fcurb inflation - this morning, it says
OL,10,Fit will "continue to set interest rates
OL,11,Fto make sure inflation returns to the
OL,12,F2% target and stays there"
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
