OL,3,ALammy urges Burnham to take UK back
OL,4,Ainto the EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Lammy has urged Andy Burnham to
OL,7,Ftake Labour into the next general
OL,8,Felection with a pledge to rejoin the
OL,9,FEuropean Union.
OL,11,FThe former deputy prime minister argued
OL,12,Fonly full membership of the bloc could
OL,13,Fdeliver economic growth alongside a
OL,14,FBritish voice on EU single market
OL,15,Frules.
OL,17,FIt comes after Burnham confirmed he
OL,18,Fwould set out options to recast the
OL,19,FUK's long-term relationship with Europe
OL,20,Fnext month, in the wake of a summit
OL,21,Fthis week to unveil a series of deals
OL,22,Fto "reset" relations.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
